<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Case cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Case cut to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney downgraded Case Corp to outperform from buy, the office of analyst Tobias Levkovich confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Action based on share price.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-15/16 to 66-15/16.</p>
